#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3dgizmoplugin.rst:23
#: febde2b1bfde49b99e112cc67f4dedd4
msgid ""
"FmodAudioStreamPlayer3DGizmoPlugin is an editor-only plugin that provides visual gizmos for "
":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>` nodes in the 3D editor viewport. It"
" displays visual indicators for the audio source's position, attenuation range, and emission "
"cone."
msgstr ""
"FmodAudioStreamPlayer3DGizmoPlugin 为三维编辑器视口中的    "
":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>`    提供位置、衰减范围和发声锥辅助图形。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3dgizmoplugin.rst:25
#: 3b300c1533c5436bb928b7a4fd36d8fb
msgid "The gizmo helps designers visualize:"
msgstr "辅助图形可显示："

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3dgizmoplugin.rst:27
#: 5755dc6da1464a23afaec6a10af0348e
msgid "The position of 3D audio sources in the scene"
msgstr "场景中三维音源的位置"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3dgizmoplugin.rst:29
#: 64de2f5b27c64d2d824b34de71235677
msgid "The maximum distance/attenuation radius"
msgstr "最大距离或衰减半径"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3dgizmoplugin.rst:31
#: 92546a8aa3744de1a7b2ab99956c803c
msgid "The directional emission cone (when enabled)"
msgstr "定向发声锥（启用时）"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3dgizmoplugin.rst:33
#: a922f9ebb9ae411eb2115b5dc3020174
msgid ""
"\\ **Note:** This is an editor-only class and is not available in exported projects. It is "
"automatically registered when the plugin loads."
msgstr "**注意：**    此类仅在编辑器中可用，导出项目中不可用。插件加载时会自动注册。"
